{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00253",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 5.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Hi, doctor. Long queue outside, but here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.59,
      "end_seconds": 10.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "You're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.02,
      "end_seconds": 17.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "I mean, I've been dealing with pain in the lower right tummy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.56,
      "end_seconds": 23.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "Right. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.34,
      "end_seconds": 41.54,
      "duration_seconds": 14.2,
      "text": "Moving and coughing definitely sets it off. Pretty severe, if I'm being honest. I, I had a low fever before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.36,
      "end_seconds": 46.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "And what about constipation, jaundice or hernia bulge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.27,
      "end_seconds": 56.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "Right, I haven't had constipation, jaundice or hernia bulge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.21,
      "end_seconds": 61.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Has there been any burning when passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.56,
      "end_seconds": 66.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Nope, no burning when passing urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.96,
      "end_seconds": 70.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.25,
      "end_seconds": 76.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.92,
      "end_seconds": 80.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.75,
      "end_seconds": 85.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "No, um, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.92,
      "end_seconds": 91.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.41,
      "end_seconds": 102.51,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "I stopped smoking about two years back. I'm mostly vegetarian. I'm retired now, I was a clerk for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.67,
      "end_seconds": 108.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Any diagnoses you've been given before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.52,
      "end_seconds": 117.72,
      "duration_seconds": 8.2,
      "text": "Yes, gout. Yes, an irregular heartbeat. Right, I've had epilepsy for two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.29,
      "end_seconds": 119.18,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.77,
      "end_seconds": 122.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "So, I've had heart disease, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.85,
      "end_seconds": 132.6,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "Yes, gout and an irregular heartbeat are known to us, good to have that clear. Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.09,
      "end_seconds": 138.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "So, I've never been told I have allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.42,
      "end_seconds": 142.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Have you ever been under the knife?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.54,
      "end_seconds": 152.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.38,
      "text": "I had a stent put in my heart two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.26,
      "end_seconds": 173.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "What's your current medication list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.29,
      "end_seconds": 187.18,
      "duration_seconds": 11.89,
      "text": "Allopurinol. I take it 100 milligrams, once a day. I'm, I'm on bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.71,
      "end_seconds": 190.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "And for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.13,
      "end_seconds": 194.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "About a month now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.35,
      "end_seconds": 195.05,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.87,
      "end_seconds": 209.44,
      "duration_seconds": 12.57,
      "text": "Sodium valproate, 500 milligrams, twice a day. I take aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day. Apixaban I don't take anymore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 211.12,
      "end_seconds": 222.59,
      "duration_seconds": 11.47,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pulse is 95 beats a minute, SpO2 98 percent on room air, respiratory rate 19. BP is 113 over 66, temp 38.1 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.44,
      "end_seconds": 225.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.36,
      "end_seconds": 230.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.11,
      "end_seconds": 234.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Tell me if anything hurts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.64,
      "end_seconds": 253.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Bowel sounds are present."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.19,
      "end_seconds": 273.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.31,
      "end_seconds": 277.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Okay, just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.22,
      "end_seconds": 294.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "There's tenderness in the right lower part and it hurts when I let go suddenly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.2,
      "end_seconds": 298.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "All done, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.66,
      "end_seconds": 330.39,
      "duration_seconds": 18.73,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, I'd lean towards possible appendicitis. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. We shouldn't forget a gastroenteritis. I want an ultrasound of the abdomen done, that's for right lower abdominal pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.4,
      "end_seconds": 335.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Okay, so how long does that take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.28,
      "end_seconds": 347.02,
      "duration_seconds": 10.74,
      "text": "Please don't eat or drink anything until the surgeons have seen you. I'd like you to see the surgical team as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 348.63,
      "end_seconds": 350.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.95,
      "end_seconds": 372.58,
      "duration_seconds": 20.63,
      "text": "Blood tests is something we might do if this doesn't improve in two weeks. Do get help quickly if the pain gets sharper or spreads across the tummy. I'd like to see you again today after the results. Call the clinic if you need us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 377.53,
      "end_seconds": 381.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "I mean, nothing more from me, thanks."
    }
  ]
}